{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"撒迦利亚书","commonName":"撒迦利亚书","title":"撒迦利亚书","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"8cf62f43a8ce797cc4cdd63e937097d1b0225901663353bd7ce9b6f60df7db51","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["约书亚大祭司"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华又让我看见约书亚大祭司站在祂的天使面前，撒旦正站在约书亚的右边控诉他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["耶和华对撒旦说：“撒旦啊，耶和华斥责你！拣选耶路撒冷的耶和华斥责你！这人岂不像从火中抽出来的一根柴吗？”"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["那时，约书亚穿着污秽的衣服站在天使面前。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["天使吩咐在他面前侍立的说：“脱掉他污秽的衣服。”他又对约书亚说：“看啊，我已除掉你的罪，我要给你穿上华美的衣服。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我说：“给他戴上洁净的礼冠。”他们便给他戴上洁净的礼冠、穿上华美的衣服。那时，耶和华的天使站在旁边。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和华的天使告诫约书亚："]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["“万军之耶和华说，‘你若遵行我的道，谨守我的吩咐，便可以管理我的家，看守我的院宇。我必让你在这些侍立的天使中间自由出入。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["约书亚大祭司啊，你和坐在你面前的同伴们听着，你们都是将来之事的预兆：我将使我仆人大卫的苗裔兴起。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["看啊，这是我在约书亚面前安置的石头，它有七眼",{"noteId":0},"，我要亲自在上面刻字，并在一天之内除掉这地方的罪。这是万军之耶和华说的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["到那天，你们将各自邀请邻居坐在葡萄树和无花果树下。这是万军之耶和华说的。’”"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"“眼”或作“面”。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}